              "public_record": "本档有新抬，Hugging Face 11月10日日榜已独立打开。新抬条目均为预印本，尚未同行评审：Reframe（多智能体在线策略蒸馏，让视觉智能体对齐工具返回的观察）[2611.12886](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12886)；How Much Training-Inference Mismatch Can On-Policy Distillation Tolerate?（在线策略蒸馏能公差多少训练—推理不一致）[2611.11450](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.11450)；Horizon-Scalable Q-Learning（任务变长时更稳地学状态—动作价值）[2611.10987](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.10987)；Spatial Harness（教视觉语言模型把空间关系落到可执行的物理世界状态上）[2611.11344](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.11344)；Sage-Taiyi（给科学发现智能体加一层元认知，先评估自己知道什么再决定下一步）[2611.12762](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12762)；Speculative Self-Distillation（用推测式自我蒸馏更省地记住新知识）[2611.12016](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12016)。\n\n今早已报、仍热、本档不复读细节：Flex-RSI [2611.08946](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.08946)、BOXBOX [2611.09218](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09218)、Goodhart in the Planner [2611.09670](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09670)、Alignment by Confident Debate [2611.09568](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09568)、Monitor-Based Interventions [2611.09828](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09828)、RuACT [2611.09597](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09597)、Learning When to Think [2611.09154](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09154)、SwarmEvolve [2611.08483](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.08483)、Steerable Multi-Objective GRPO [2611.09634](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.09634)。脚注可见、不升为主条：SciMARS [2611.12552](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12552)、Agentic-OPD [2611.12799](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12799)、PORT [2611.12763](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.12763)。本档跳过扩散、视频生成类日榜条目。",
              "sources": [
                "Hugging Face 11月10日日榜",
                "arXiv"
              ],
